     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><font size=\"4\" face=\"georgia, serif\">Dear all,</font><div><font size=\"4\" face=\"georgia, serif\"><br></font></div><div><font size=\"4\" face=\"georgia, serif\">Thanks, so now I know that my data format is fine, and I just should use <span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,102)\">‘remove.extracaps to TRUE’</span><font color=\"#000066\"><span>  for running the  </span></font><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,102)\">binomial model (using encmod = “B”), OR set </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,102)\">‘remove.extracaps to FALSE&quot;  in order to run the </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,102)\">Poisson model (using encmod = “P”).</span></font></div><div><font size=\"4\" face=\"georgia, serif\"><br></font></div><div><font size=\"4\" face=\"georgia, serif\">Thanks again!<br></font></div><div><br></div><div>Best!!!!!</div><div><br></div><div>Victor</div></div>"
    ],
