     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br></div><div><br>El lunes, 24 de septiembre de 2018, 17:42:27 (UTC+2), <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">vma...@fen.uchile.cl</a>  escribió:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><font size=\"4\" face=\"times new roman, serif\"><br></font><div><p style=\"margin-bottom:0in\"><font size=\"4\" face=\"times new roman, serif\" color=\"#0000ff\">Dear oSCR team,</font></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><font size=\"4\" face=\"times new roman, serif\"><br></font></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0in\"><font size=\"4\" face=\"times new roman, serif\" color=\"#0000ff\">Im Victor again. I have a question about data entry for oSCR (<span style=\"font-style:italic\">Encounter Data File, EDF)</span></font></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0in\"><font size=\"4\" face=\"times new roman, serif\" color=\"#0000ff\"><br></font></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0in\"><font size=\"4\" face=\"times new roman, serif\" color=\"#0000ff\"><span>This is my question: How to code that an animal </span><b>was detected multiple times</b><span> during the </span><b>same sample occasion</b><span> and </span><b>in the same trap</b><span>?. </span></font></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0in\"><font size=\"4\" face=\"times new roman, serif\" color=\"#0000ff\"><br></font></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0in\"><font size=\"4\" face=\"times new roman, serif\" color=\"#0000ff\">In the toy example below, the same animal (ID=1) was detected 5 times (rows in red) during the same occasion (Sample </font><span style=\"color:rgb(33,53,58);font-family:&quot;times new roman&quot;,serif;font-size:large\">Occasion =3)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255);font-family:&quot;times new roman&quot;,serif;font-size:large\"> and in the same trap (TrapID = 51).</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0in\"><font size=\"4\" face=\"times new roman, serif\" color=\"#0000ff\"><br></font></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0in\"><font size=\"4\" face=\"times new roman, serif\" color=\"#0000ff\">In my data, I can measure how many times an animal visit a trap during 1 day (1 day of measurement is my unit of sample occasion)</font></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0in\"><font size=\"4\" face=\"times new roman, serif\" color=\"#0000ff\"><br></font></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0in\"><font size=\"4\" face=\"times new roman, serif\"><font color=\"#0000ff\">This data entry is OK for oSCR?</font><font color=\"#000000\"></font></font></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><font size=\"4\" face=\"times new roman, serif\"><br></font></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0in;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><font size=\"4\" face=\"times new roman, serif\"><br></font></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0.08in;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><font color=\"#21353a\"><font size=\"4\" face=\"times new roman, serif\">Session ID Occasion trapID </font></font></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0.08in;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><font size=\"4\" face=\"times new roman, serif\"><font color=\"#0000ce\">1</font><font color=\"#21353a\">,]</font><font color=\"#0000ce\">1 1 1  21 </font></font></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0.08in;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><font color=\"#ff3333\"><font size=\"4\" face=\"times new roman, serif\">[3,] 1 1 3 51 </font></font></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0.08in;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><font color=\"#ff3333\"><font size=\"4\" face=\"times new roman, serif\">[4,] 1 1 3 51 </font></font></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0.08in;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><font color=\"#ff3333\"><font size=\"4\" face=\"times new roman, serif\">[5,] 1 1 3 51 </font></font></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0.08in;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><font color=\"#ff3333\"><font size=\"4\" face=\"times new roman, serif\">[6,] 1 1 3 51 </font></font></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0.08in;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><font color=\"#ff3333\"><font size=\"4\" face=\"times new roman, serif\">[7,] 1 1 3 51 </font></font></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0.08in;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><font size=\"4\" face=\"times new roman,